** Probe: the two BLPINPUT forms (soset.f BL_AVGINP). Eight fields = no
** group ID: the parameters go to the implicit group ALL and, with no
** BLPGROUP card, every BUOYLINE source belongs to it (EPA's baldwin and
** allsrcs decks). Nine fields name the group, and BLPGROUP must then
** name a BLPINPUT group (E502 otherwise). A second eight-field card is
** E201. This deck is the implicit form; 16b is the explicit one.
